  "assemblyNotes": [
    "Left cap → N center tiles → right cap. All modules use the same y and 256 px canvas stride. Caps have an outer margin; only their inward edge joins the rail.",
    "Stationary chassis and moving tread are separate. Two companion hubs reuse the same roller animation. Mount centers: left [67,145], right [184,148].",
    "Starting and stopping are rightward one-shots. Stop after moving-right frame 5 to reach the idle tread exactly. Leftward loop is supplied separately.",
    "The belt is periodic after 64 px; center canvases span four tread periods. Render tiles unscaled on the same pixel grid for seam-free joins."
  ],
